{"shortDescription":"Management CommentaryIn the 2025/2026 financial year, the Group continued to implement the debt restructuring plan agreed in the 2024/2025 financial year. At the end of the financial year, the Group successfully completed its exit from the Saaremaa production unit in Estonia, resulting in a one-off…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Management Commentary"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["In the 2025/2026 financial year, the Group continued to implement the debt restructuring plan agreed in the 2024/2025 financial year. At the end of the financial year, the Group successfully completed its exit from the Saaremaa production unit in Estonia, resulting in a one-off gain of EUR 1.0 million, with total proceeds from the disposal amounting to EUR 2.3 million. The sale of the Saaremaa unit brought the Group’s production activities in Estonia to an end and enables the Group to focus on higher value-added products in the UK market. The Management Board would like to thank the Saaremaa team for their contribution and acknowledge Management Board member Timo Pärn for his work in managing the unit and the Group as a whole."]},{"type":"p","children":["The table below provides a summary of the Group’s results from discontinued and continuing operations."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[" "]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[" "]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":4},"children":["2025/2026"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"rowspan":2},"children":["mln EUR"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"rowspan":2},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["Discontinued operations"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","